cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use linkgym, please cite it as below."
title: "linkgym: A Gymnasium environment for 5G NR link adaptation"
abstract: >-
  linkgym is a Gymnasium environment for 5G NR link adaptation (MCS selection) built on
  NVIDIA Sionna SYS, with TDL and ray-traced channels, classical baselines and a fixed
  evaluation protocol. It includes a Sionna RT trace generator and a published ray-traced
  dataset of Munich streets.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Rodrigues
    given-names: Pedro
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-03
repository-code: "https://github.com/Tempip/linkgym"
url: "https://github.com/Tempip/linkgym"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - 5G NR
  - link adaptation
  - MCS selection
  - reinforcement learning
  - Gymnasium
  - Sionna
  - ray tracing
